        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Graham Masterton\n- Organizations: Mayfair, Penthouse\n- Products: The Manitou, Famine\n- Topics: horror fiction, magazine publishing\n\nFacts:\n- Mayfair was founded in 1965 as a response to US magazines such as Playboy and Penthouse, which had recently launched in the UK.\n- Graham Masterton was born on 16 January 1946 in Edinburgh and is a British horror author.\n- Graham Masterton was originally editor of Mayfair and the British edition of Penthouse.\n- Graham Masterton's first novel, The Manitou, was released in 1976.\n- Famine is a 1981 horror novel written by Scottish writer Graham Masterton.",
